  description: 'Put the enemy to sleep for 2 turns: it skips them and can''t evade,
    and attacks don''t wake it up. While it sleeps, your normal attacks on it deal
    60% less damage and your Mana Regeneration is cut to 80%. Mana cost: 100.'
